{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"financial-maroon-toucan","creation_channel":"cli","description":"# Context\nLive External Integration run 31587452003 (operator-sanctioned dispatch) failed both live-LLM suite arms (anthropic + openai) on two pure-configuration causes, in addition to the DC-harness residuals tracked elsewhere:\n\n1. **Bedrock region unset in the workflow env**: `tests/external/test_completion_banking_behavior_0707.py` cells fail with \"a bedrock model/provider is configured but no AWS region could be resolved. Set REBAR_LLM_BEDROCK_REGION ... or AWS_DEFAULT_REGION\". The external-integration workflow does not export the region, so every bedrock-routed step fails identically. (Note per the error text: AWS_REGION alone does NOT resolve — AWS_DEFAULT_REGION or REBAR_LLM_BEDROCK_REGION is required.)\n2. **ANTHROPIC_API_KEY repository secret missing**: the anthropic arm emits `::error title=anthropic arm has no credential::Set the ANTHROPIC_API_KEY repository secret` — by design it FAILS rather than skips so a missing secret can never read as a green live run. Adding the secret is an OPERATOR action (repo settings), not a code change.\n\n# Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] AC1 — The external-integration workflow env exports `REBAR_LLM_BEDROCK_REGION` (matching the region the Verified-gate lanes use, us-east-1) for the live-LLM suite jobs, so bedrock-routed steps resolve a region.\n- [ ] AC2 — The 0707 banking cells no longer fail on region resolution in the next live run (evidence: run link or [operator-attested] with the run's job output).\n- [ ] AC3 — The ANTHROPIC_API_KEY gap is recorded as an operator action in a comment (adding the secret itself is out of scope for an agent; the arm's fail-not-skip design is correct and must not be changed).","id":"79d6-7e6e-e1c0-4c20","parent_id":"","priority":2,"tags":[],"ticket_type":"bug","title":"Live-LLM external lane fails on unset bedrock region; anthropic arm lacks secret"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1786533661537838001,"uuid":"9b1e7638-2e42-4e92-bf64-c86a21ead542"}